== Hindsight-inspired agent memory ==
An agent retains documents, consolidates their facts into versioned beliefs, keeps a standing answer current, and reflects from the highest layer that already knows.
Genie structures: ownership tree, event log, temporal collection, keyed collection, property graph, two versioned records, lineage DAG

Tools available to the agent:
- register_entity: Declare a canonical entity and the surface forms it answers to.
- retain: Store one source payload and the facts extracted from it, resolving entities and recording provenance.
- link_memories: Connect two facts with a temporal, semantic, or causal link.
- invalidate_memory: Soft-retire one fact so it stops being recalled but stays auditable.
- consolidate: Fold the facts retained since the last run into versioned observations.
- create_mental_model: Register a standing question whose answer the bank keeps current.
- refresh_mental_model: Rebuild a standing answer, writing a version only if its scope changed.
- get_mental_model: Read the current standing answer and the versions before it.
- recall: Rank facts and observations with the similarity, keyword, graph, and temporal retrievers, fused and capped at a token budget.
- reflect: Answer from the highest layer that knows: mental model, then observations, then raw facts, reporting the evidence used.

Agent answer:
Question: What should I know before I change Northwind billing?
Mental model northwind-change-brief r3: Northwind frontends are built in Vue. Previously: Northwind frontends are built in React. Northwind billing migrations finish only in small batches.
- was r1: Northwind frontends are built in React.
- was r2: Northwind frontends are built in React. Northwind billing migrations finish only in small batches.
Recalled for 'Northwind billing migration batches' (40/45 tokens, 4 dropped):
- [experience] I retried the Northwind billing migration on March 9 in four small batches and it succeeded. (similarity+keyword+graph+temporal, 0.0648)
- [world] The Northwind billing service stores its data in Postgres. (similarity+keyword+graph+temporal, 0.0633)
- [experience] I migrated Northwind billing in one batch on February 3 and the migration timed out. (similarity+keyword+graph, 0.0487)
Reflection (search_mental_models -> search_observations -> recall):
- Northwind frontends are built in Vue. Previously: Northwind frontends are built in React. Northwind billing migrations finish only in small batches.
